ei\">📚</div><div class=\"en\">Ubuntu Academy</div><div class=\"ed\">Free CV and job readiness workshops</div><div class=\"eb\"><button>Learn more →</button></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🎵</div><div class=\"en\">Orbit Music</div><div class=\"ed\">Create music with AI — workshops and tools</div><div class=\"eb\"><button>Learn more →</button></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🎙️</div><div class=\"en\">Inside.Town</div><div class=\"ed\">Host a podcast — tell your town&#x27;s story</div><div class=\"eb\"><button>Learn more →</button></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🏠</div><div class=\"en\">FamilyHouse</div><div class=\"ed\">Host visitors in your home — earn from hospitality</div><div class=\"eb\"><button>Learn more →</button></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🌿</div><div class=\"en\">EcoChar</div><div class=\"ed\">5-day charcoal production training — green economy skills</div><div class=\"eb\"><button>Learn more →</button></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🍺</div><div class=\"en\">BuntuBar</div><div class=\"ed\">Mobile bar and beverage workshop — events economy</div><div class=\"eb\"><button>Learn more →</button></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:8px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The twin</span><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5px;margin:10px 0\">Modules &amp; render state</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:0.88px;margin-bottom:14px\">Modules light up as the coordinator banks proof.<!-- --> <b style=\"color:var(--green-deep)\">Live</b> = published ·<!-- --> <b style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">Ready</b> = data present ·<!-- --> <b style=\"color:var(--muted)\">Locked</b> = gate not met.</p><div class=\"rail\"><div class=\"rl locked\"><div class=\"e\">🗺️</div><div class=\"t\">GIS Map</div><div class=\"s locked\">○ LOCKED</div></div><div class=\"rl locked\"><div class=\"e\">📊</div><div class=\"t\">Dashboard</div><div class=\"s locked\">○ LOCKED</div></div><div class=\"rl locked\"><div class=\"e\">📋</div><div class=\"t\">Prospectus</div><div class=\"s locked\">○ LOCKED</div></div><div class=\"rl locked\"><div class=\"e\">🔬</div><div class=\"t\">Intelligence</div><div class=\"s locked\">○ LOCKED</div></div><div class=\"rl locked\"><div class=\"e\">🧭</div><div class=\"t\">Tourism</div><div class=\"s locked\">○ LOCKED</div></div><div class=\"rl locked\"><div class=\"e\">📄</div><div class=\"t\">Factsheet</div><div class=\"s locked\">○ LOCKED</div></div><div class=\"rl locked\"><div class=\"e\">🎯</div><div class=\"t\">Deck</div><div class=\"s locked\">○ LOCKED</div></div><div class=\"rl locked\"><div class=\"e\">🛠️</div><div class=\"t\">Workspace</div><div class=\"s locked\">○ LOCKED</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:8px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The model</span><h2 style=\"margin:12px;font-size:1.5px\">Signals become memory. Memory drives action.</h2><div class=\"loopline\" style=\"justify-content:center;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink)\">Signal<span class=\"a\">→</span>Workpack<span class=\"a\">→</span>Proof<span class=\"a\">→</span>Memory<span class=\"a\">→</span>Action</div></section></div><footer class=\"site\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"logo\"><div class=\"mark\">🏘️</div><div><div class=\"wm\" style=\"color:var(--creamhi)\">Ubuntu Town</div><div class=\"tg\">Abantu Bo Buntu</div></div></div><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:12px;max-width:660px\">Wepener — illustrative network state. Light CI · enter.ubuntutown.co.za</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><!--$?--><template id=\"B:0\"></template><!--/$--><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></section><!--/$--><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-adb20c8ee35e1ac5.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidd