ds a special place in South African history as the birthplace of Oliver Reginald Tambo, ANC president and anti-apartheid leader. This small southern Free State town is working to preserve and celebrate this heritage.\\\",\\\"population_estimate\\\":1200,\\\"archetype\\\":\\\"heritage_town\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"rosendal\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Rosendal\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"Dihlabeng · arts hamlet\\\",\\\"district\\\":\\\"Thabo Mofutsanyana\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ghost\\\",\\\"render_pct\\\":0,\\\"opportunity_potential\\\":16,\\\"heritage\\\":true,\\\"coordinator_status\\\":\\\"recruiting\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"/town/rosendal\\\",\\\"illustrative\\\":true,\\\"lat\\\":-28.5333,\\\"lng\\\":27.9833,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Arts hamlet known for galleries, craft markets, and stunning Maluti Mountain views.\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"paul-roux\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Paul Roux\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"Dihlabeng · sandstone village\\\",\\\"district\\\":\\\"Thabo Mofutsanyana\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ghost\\\",\\\"render_pct\\\":0,\\\"opportunity_potential\\\":15,\\\"heritage\\\":false,\\\"coordinator_status\\\":\\\"recruiting\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"/town/paul-roux\\\",\\\"illustrative\\\":true,\\\"lat\\\":-28.3,\\\"lng\\\":27.95,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Small sandstone village in the Dihlabeng municipality, surrounded by farmlands.\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"bloemfontein\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bloemfontein\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"building\\\",\\\"render_pct\\\":55,\\\"opportunity_potential\\\":75,\\\"coordinator_status\\\":\\\"assigned\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"/town/bloemfontein\\\",\\\"illustrative\\\":false,\\\"coordinator_name\\\":\\\"Tshabalala Katleho Alfred\\\",\\\"youth_mapped\\\":145,\\\"active_signals\\\":1,\\\"open_opportunities\\\":3,\\\"lat\\\":-29.0852,\\\"lng\\\":26.1596,\\\"description\\\":\\\"The judicial capital of South Africa and City of Roses, Bloemfontein sits at the heart of the Free State where the National Museum, Naval Hill, and the University of the